      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="marquee" aria-hidden="true"><div class="marquee-track">
  {[...Array(2)].map(() => ["Retirement mandate","Tip credit","Section 125","Startup credits","20 minutes · no pitch","Official Paychex Partner","Las Vegas · Nevada"].map(t => <><span>{t}</span><span class="mq-star">✦</span></>))}
</div></div>

<section class="band" id="doors"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="section-label">Four doors, one story</p>
  <h2>The reason you're not claiming it is structure, not eligibility.</h2>
